# TDA7439 symbol (KiCad library format placeholder)
# Pins are listed per functional groups; use datasheet to verify pin numbers when creating real symbol.
# This is a human-readable placeholder to be converted into a real .lib by importing into KiCad symbol editor.

TDA7439
# Power pins
VCC : POWER_INPUT
GND : POWER_INPUT

# Control
SCL  : SIGNAL
SDA  : SIGNAL
MUTE : SIGNAL
RESET: SIGNAL

# Inputs
IN1L : SIGNAL
IN1R : SIGNAL
IN2L : SIGNAL
IN2R : SIGNAL
IN3L : SIGNAL
IN3R : SIGNAL

# Outputs
OUTL : SIGNAL
OUTR : SIGNAL

# Notes:
# - When creating the symbol in KiCad, set the footprint field to the package used (e.g. SSOP-28 or SO-28 per datasheet)
# - Add fields: Manufacturer, PartNumber, DatasheetURL
